{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e2a3d6006945d28030df","chatId":"5e0deab3f4f5451ea8e31a5613306f00","sessionId":null,"userId":60128,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":878,"promptTokens":1522,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:36:03"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00317218212250345,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e2a3d6006945d28030de","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368163938,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:36:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e2a3d6006945d28030de","chatId":"5e0deab3f4f5451ea8e31a5613306f00","sessionId":null,"userId":60128,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n小明和小红一起是社区活动的组织者。因为涉及到儿童游乐设施的安装,所以他们开始关注到了小刚——一个常年在社区里修理设施的工人。小明看着足球场上玩球的小红，对小红眨了眨眼，然后向小刚看去，小刚正在边上修理一个秋千。接着，小明对小红深深地露出了一个微笑。小红似懂非懂地点了点头，继续将视线放回到足球。\n\n[问题]\n你觉得小红的感觉如何？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小红心中有了压力，担忧自己没办法将小刚拉进他们的活动。\nB. 小红对小明的意图毫无察觉，只是专注于玩足球。\nC. 小红感觉很尴尬，因为她觉得小明的笑很奇怪。\nD. 小红知道小明让她注意小刚，但是具体不明白小明的意图，因此有些疑惑。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00317218212250345,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e2a3d6006945d28030df","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368163935,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:36:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"41a067cfd27f47cc99d3eae7cf499b51"}